<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $61-1/4(FIM 304.80).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $61-1/4(FIM 304.80).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-1/4 at $61-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 304.80 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 6.00 markka at 307.50 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended up $0-1/4 at $37-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 92.70 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.50  markka at 95.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR rose $0-1/2 to $22-5/8 in New York on Tuesday. The price equals about 112.60 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Rauma closed up 2.00 markka at 115.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
